# NutriOCR

NutriOCR is a capstone project that explores OCR-based calorie tracking from food packaging labels.
Made by Olga Doboler, OPIT BCs in Computer Science student.

## Technologies

- Python
- PaddleOCR 3.3.3 (PPStructureV3)
- PaddlePaddle 3.2.0 (CPU config)
- OpenAI Vision API (gpt-5)
- Ollama (Gemma3 Vision)

## Project Status

Early prototype.

Current functionality:
- Process food label images
- Extract text using OCR
- Save OCR results to text files

## Running

Create a virtual environment and install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt